> Thank you. This *does* work indeed. But in order to do this, most of my models have to be in a "transformed parameter"
> section (see attached file),

transformed parameters {
   vector[2]	lp;
   for (i in 1:2) {
     // Prior sur l'�cart-type
     lp[i]<-inv_gamma_log(Sigmas[i],Alpha,Beta);
     // prior sur les param�tres de r�gression
     lp[i]<-lp[i]+multi_normal_log(Betas[i],Prior_mean,Prior_vcv);
     // Mod�le des donn�es
     lp[i]<-lp[i]+normal_log(Y,Data[i]*Betas[i], sqrt(Sigmas[i]));
