P.S.  I've been thinking a bit more about the way we handle character
       data and I don't see any reason why using UTF-8 comments won't work.
       I'm going to think some more and add some notes to the doc if I
       can convince myself it won't cause any issues (I'm much less familiar
       with C++ character encoding conventions and how it's going to interact
       with the parser we use [Boost Spirit Qi] than I am with how it's done
