Subject: Problem with a simple mixture of normals.
Message-ID: <StoxJsaFm_I.Pw48lRiMsxsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/StoxJsaFm_I/m/Pw48lRiMsxsJ>
