Subject: Variance structure
Message-ID: <EmjP_GNm38E.kHcEJw8Cmm4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/EmjP_GNm38E/m/kHcEJw8Cmm4J>
