Subject: initial values problem with truncated poisson (partly rstan)
Message-ID: <4-arkRj-eNw.H-gktB79weoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/4-arkRj-eNw/m/H-gktB79weoJ>
