From: ua5e83218c834e013 at groups.google.com (Michael Betancourt)
Date: Mon, 14 Oct 2013 08:22:19 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] More iterations -> worse convergence ?
Message-ID: <Fl3RBPscUXo.19Vka8PgXxEJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Fl3RBPscUXo.efYetkXEy-YJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <Fl3RBPscUXo.efYetkXEy-YJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
