FH,

Thanks for sending the model. I'm definitely seeing the issue.

I ran with 1000 warmup, 1000 samples (defaults).

v1.3: takes ~30 sec for n_eff between 394--1000, most of them at 1000
v2.0: takes ~20 mins for n_eff between 5--30.

For anyone else that wants to help track this issue down, I'm attaching the model and data as stand-alone files.

Daniel

