make a pull request through GitHub.

Then we (and by that I mean Jiqiang or Ben or someone else who
knows R better than me) can review the code and decide whether to
merge or to require fixes or other further work.

We want tests and documentation along with pull requests whenever
possible.  Nothing should get merged into the main development branch
until that's done.

- Bob

