I completely understand and am ready to switch full-time to Stan 2.0.

Another (potentially helpful) update. After a bit more digging, I came across this post <http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19546672/rcpp-error-with-xcode-5-0-and-osx-10-8-5-and-r-3-0-2> and can now successfully install packages from source code in Mavericks. However, I still can't install RStan 2.0.0 on Mavericks and believe that the issue is actually specific to RStan after all. Not sure if this is an easy check for folks before the RStan 2.0.1 release or not, but wanted to flag it.

