Subject: Re: [stan-users] multivariate multilevel model, extremely slow
Message-ID: <XHFjmUs78mo.6uv1R5rUTLoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <XHFjmUs78mo.ffVT4jnPn80J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
