Subject: Re: [stan-users] distribution for a simplex
Message-ID: <Rza12R4NBpg.jF7sYH7GkB8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Rza12R4NBpg.Y6-lJdqgqdwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <Rza12R4NBpg.Y6-lJdqgqdwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
