>
>     I have the model working in stan, and works fine and converged. But, out of bayesian analysis this model would be
>     unidentified since we have a product of 2 unknown parameters (B2*D).
>
>     How is that a model like thid is identified in bayesian but is not in the frequentist analysis?
>
